# Nougat extraction — arXiv:2107.07756

**Note:** Nougat (Meta's neural PDF-to-Markdown model) is not installed here
and the central corpus has no pre-parsed .mmd for this paper. As a fallback,
this file contains the same pdftotext `-layout` extraction as `marker.md`,
lightly re-formatted. Mathematical equations from the Methods (Eqs 1-4) are
included in the source .txt in linearized form; the LaTeX equivalents used
in the replication code are in report/evidence/bbm92_key_rate.py.

